<section class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
        <h1>Answers to common questions.</h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="result-list">
      <div class="page-card">
        <h3>How long does custom work take?</h3>
        <p>Most custom crochet orders take 3–7 working days depending on the size of the design, materials, and finishing details.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-card">
        <h3>Do you offer gift packaging?</h3>
        <p>Yes — we offer gift box styling, handwritten notes, and luxury packaging options for many of our creations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-card">
        <h3>Can I request specific colours?</h3>
        <p>Absolutely. We can often tailor colourways to your preference, occasion, or home aesthetic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="page-card" id="delivery">
        <h3>Do you deliver?</h3>
        <p><%= settings && settings.delivery_info ? settings.delivery_info : 'We arrange delivery across Nairobi and beyond. Delivery options, costs, and timing are confirmed with you after your order enquiry.' %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
